{#
  resume.html.j2 — turns resume.json into printable HTML.

  Contract with the rest of the system:
    * receives the resume.json keys as top-level variables, plus an
      optional `scale` float (default 1.0) — the fit loop's knob
    * all body text passes through Jinja2 autoescape, so content may
      contain &, <, >, quotes freely — invariant #1 enforced here
    * icons are inline SVG: zero network dependencies in the render path
#}
